    "title": "DLCCC Rec Program Underway for Summer - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dave Bishop ,\n10 hours ago The summer Rec program hosted by the Detroit Lakes Community and Cultural Center is now underway at City Park in Detroit Lakes. According to DLCCC staff, the program began June 1 and offers a variety of free activities for area youth throughout the summer. Participants can enjoy games, crafts, equipment checkout, and organized group activities each day. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
